Clear Sky started with one person and one account.

After leaving college with a Cinematic Arts degree and retiring his Major League Baseball dreams, Cameron mixed his two passions and started a niche baseball account on Instagram, TikTok, and YouTube. Over the next two years he found he had a skill most businesses suddenly needed in 2020: making content that people stop scrolling for.

So he started Clear Sky with a simple mission. Help businesses grow their visibility on social media through quality content.

## From one person to a full team

Each project was better than the one before. The team grew and the services widened, and over five years Clear Sky became a full-service creative agency.

## The trend we couldn't ignore

Social media today is crowded with misleading ads, fake news, and a sales-at-all-costs mindset. Trust in brands is at an all-time low, and people are worn out by the platforms.

We think social media needs a renaissance.

## What we're building

Our mission is to build good brands with honest content. We help CEOs, creators, and marketing teams make a difference in how content gets made and consumed, and we only use ethical methods to promote your business. We're rooted in transparency, integrity, love, and selflessness.

Because changed companies change culture.
